5	Given model $\mathcal{M}$ and input $x$, we sample $N$ outputs $\{y_1, \ldots, y_N\}$ at temperature $T > 0$ via constrained decoding \cite{willard2023guided}, where each $y_i$ is an entity set (NER) or relation set (RE).
